title: FindFriendQuest
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: QuestGiver
---
<<declare $questStarted = false>>
<<declare $foundFriend1 = false>>
<<declare $foundFriend2 = false>>
<<declare $questComplete = false>>

<<if $questComplete>>
    <<portrait Emi>>
    Emi: You found both of them! Thank you so much!
    <<stop>>
<<elseif $questStarted>>
    <<if $foundFriend1 and $foundFriend2>>
        <<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: You found them both! I knew I could count on you.
        <<portrait Mokki>>
        Mokki: I'm glad I could help!
        <<set $questComplete = true>>
        <<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: Thanks for bringing our friends back together!
        <<stop>>
    <<else>>
        <<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: Have you found my friends yet?
        <<if not $foundFriend1 and not $foundFriend2>>
            Emi: You haven't found either of them yet. Please keep looking!
        <<elseif not $foundFriend1>>
            Emi: You've found one friend, but Friend 1 is still missing.
        <<elseif not $foundFriend2>>
            Emi: You've found one friend, but Friend 2 is still missing.
        <<endif>>
        <<portrait Mokki>>
        -> I'll keep looking.
            <<stop>>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    <<portrait Emi>>
    Emi: Hey! I can't find my two friends anywhere.
    Emi: Could you go find them for me?
    <<portrait Mokki>>
    -> I'll find them!
        <<set $questStarted = true>>
        <<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: Thank you! Please talk to both of them.
        <<stop>>
    <<portrait Mokki>>
    -> Sorry, not right now.
        <<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: Okay. Let me know if you change your mind.
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Friend1
---
<<portrait Friend1>>
<<if not $questStarted>>
    Friend1: Hey! What's up?
<<elseif $foundFriend1>>
    Friend1: We've already talked! Go tell our friend I'm here.
<<else>>
    Friend1: Oh, you're looking for me?
    Friend1: I'm right here! Thanks for checking on me.
    <<set $foundFriend1 = true>>
    Friend1: Go find our other friend, too!
<<endif>>
===

title: Friend2
---
<<portrait Friend2>>
<<if not $questStarted>>
    Friend2: Hey! What's up?
<<elseif $foundFriend2>>
    Friend2: You've already found me! Go tell our friend.
<<else>>
    Friend2: Oh, our friend sent you to find me?
    Friend2: I'm okay! Thanks for checking.
    <<set $foundFriend2 = true>>
    Friend2: Now go find our other friend!
<<endif>>
===